{"id": "1543602217678934016", "channel_id": "1543602217678934016", "author_id": "395862678205366273", "author_name": "yumemikokochi_beaker", "content": "I offered to translate this piece of... whatever from the CN community :D before I start uni yayayay\nnever read a single en light novel so I didn't know how to replicate that tone orz\n\n\n(Part 1)\nWhen Morimens announced its EOS, as the others started uninstalling the app, I whaled and whaled desperately into the game, to the point of taking out heaps of loans from the bank. They all called me a madman, a Light bootlicker, but I paid them no mind. For only I knew: \nThe day Morimens announces its EOS, is the day Dissolution dawns upon us all.\nIn my last life, I deleted Morimens soon after the announcement. Disappointed by the crappy Astral Reign writing, leaving the game in my phone was simply an act of longing, the EOS announcement thus the straw that broke the camel’s back. Having bade farewell to the past, my life continued as usual, until the day the game officially ended.\n\nI recall clearly: it was a Friday. After returning from work in the evening, as I was about to welcome the wonderful weekend, a colossal, black triangular rift had shown up in the sky. I had thought that I was hallucinating, as not a single pedestrian reacted to it. But soon after, the friend I met from playing Morimens came along.\n“Do you see that thing in the sky?” he asked.\n“You mean the giant triangle?”\n“Yeah, no matter what, that has to be…”\n“Dissolution.” \nWe spoke at once.\n\nI opened Discord, and realised that the official server was gone, so I checked the server created by me and my mutuals instead. Upon exchanging what we know, I had learnt that only those who had played Morimens can see Dissolution. As for those who hadn’t uninstalled the game, a Silver Key would appear before them, and the Awakeners within the game would fight alongside them, against Dissoluted beings.", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T12:44:07.437000+00:00", "thread_id": "1543602217678934016", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-30T12:46:10.535000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🛐", "emoji_id": null, "count": 5}], "thread_title": "(unserious EN translation) I Was Reborn, on the Day Morimens Announced Its End of Service", "forum_channel_id": "1304022107847659520", "thread_tags": ["1304022240605638706"], "is_thread_starter": true}
